  "content": "[Intro]\n[E]  [Esus4]\n[D]  [E]\n[E]  [Esus4]\n[D]  [E]\n[E]  [Esus4]\n[D]  [E]\n[E]  [Esus4]\n[B]  [A]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[E][Esus4]She just woke\n[D]up but [E]she´s still tired\n[E][Esus4]is that the\n[D]telephone [E]ringing\n[E][Esus4]The curtains\n[D]can´t hold [E]back the lite\n[E][Esus4]That´s reaching\n\n[Pre Chorus]\n[Esus4/D]into her [E/D]dreams\n[C#m7#5]down in her [C#m7]heart.\n[E/B]If it had [B]fingers it´d be\n[G]tearing you apart.\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]You be looking groovy\n[F#]in a sixties movie.\n[G#m]Maybe tell the press you [A]died.\n[C#m]Little legend baby\n[B]try your very best to hide.\n[C#m/A#]A\n[A]green tinted [B]sixties\n\n[Interlude]\n[E]mind. [Esus4]\n[D]  [E]\n[E/F#]  [Esus4/F#]\n[B]  [A]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[E][Esus4]She keeps\n[D]memories [E]locked away\n[E][Esus4]But they are\n[D]always [E]escaping.\n[E][Esus4]Neglect won´t\n[D]make them [E]fade away.\n[E][Esus4]That´s reaching\n\n[Pre Chorus]\n[Esus4/D]into her [E/D]dreams\n[C#m7#5]down in her [C#m7]heart.\n[E/B]Don´t need [B]fingers to be\n[G]tearing it apart.\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]Gotta face the day there-\n[F#]´s no other wayto\n[G#m]clear the fog inside your [A]mind.\n[C#m]Fill it up with dreams but\n[B]all that you can seem to find.\n[C#m/A#]A\n[A]green tinted [B]sixties\n\n[Solo]\n[E]mind.\n[C#m]\n[D]\n[B5]\n[A5]\n[Ab5]\n[G5]\n[F#5]\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]Hanging out with Janis\n[F#]moving to Atlantis\n[G#m]Could have made it if you [A]tried.\n[C#m]What´s the point of force it´s\n[B]easy as a horse to ride\n[C#m/A#]A\n[A]green tinted [B]sixties mind.\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]You be looking groovy\n[F#]in a sixties movie.\n[G#m]Maybe tell the press you [A]died.\n[C#m]Little legend baby\n[B]try your very best to hide.\n[C#m/A#]A\n[A]green tinted [B]sixties\n\n[Outro]\n[E]mind. [Esus4]\n[D]  [E]\n[E]  [Esus4]\n[D]  [E]\n[E]  [Esus4]\n[D]  [E]\n[E]  [Esus4]\n[D]  [E]",
